VALUES (2001040, 1040, 'image', 'Vintage 1962 Havana Street Leica M3 Photography', 'vintage-havana-leica-photography', 'Cinematic & Film', 'cinematic', 'free', true, '3:2', 'Flux.1 Dev / Midjourney', '18 Oct 2026', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80', '["Vintage","Street Photography","Havana","Leica M3","1960s"]'::jsonb, 'Authentic 1960s Kodachrome street photograph in Havana Cuba with classic pastel pink Chevrolet and historic colonial balconies.', 'Street photography in Old Havana Cuba 1962, a mint pastel pink vintage 1957 Chevrolet Bel Air parked along cobblestone alley beneath decaying Spanish colonial balconies with vibrant bougainvillea flowers. Golden tropical afternoon sun casting long diagonal shadows, warm Kodak Kodachrome 64 film stock grain, rich color saturation, authentic vintage texture, shot on Leica M3 with Summicron 50mm f/2 lens, Vivian Maier documentary style --ar 3:2 --style raw', 'modern cars, smartphones, modern clothing, oversaturated HDR, digital look', '{"aspectRatio":"3:2 (Classic 35mm Film Frame)","recommendedModel":"Flux.1 Dev / Midjourney v6.1","guidanceScale":"3.5","sampler":"Euler A"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb)
