VALUES (2001060, 1060, 'image', 'Cybernetic Geisha with Chrome Ceramic Mask', 'cybernetic-geisha-chrome-mask', 'Sci-Fi & Cyberpunk', 'scifi', 'free', true, '9:16', 'Midjourney v6.1 / Flux.1', '16 Oct 2026', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578632767115-351597cf2477?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80', '["Cyberpunk","Geisha","Chrome","Fashion","Futuristic"]'::jsonb, 'Avant-garde futuristic haute couture portrait of a Japanese cyber geisha with polished white porcelain and mirrored chrome face plates.', 'Haute couture high-fashion portrait of an elegant futuristic cybernetic geisha. Half of face covered in polished white lacquer porcelain with gold kintsugi seams, the other half exposed chrome titanium mechanics and glowing fiber-optic hair pins. Traditional silk kimono embroidered with neon circuit board patterns, moody dark studio portrait, soft cyan and crimson rim light, shot on Canon 1D X Mark III, 100mm macro lens, 8k --ar 9:16 --v 6.1', 'ugly, blurry, bad anatomy, deformed eyes, amateur cosplay, anime 2d', '{"aspectRatio":"9:16","recommendedModel":"Midjourney v6.1","guidanceScale":"Stylize 200","sampler":"DPM++ 2M"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb)
