VALUES (2001130, 1130, 'image', 'Kyoto Zen Rock Garden Autumn Morning Fog', 'kyoto-zen-rock-garden-autumn', 'Architecture & Spaces', 'architecture', 'free', false, '16:9', 'Midjourney v6.1 / Flux.1', '9 Oct 2026', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503899036084-c55cdd92da26?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80', '["Japan","Zen","Garden","Architecture","Peaceful"]'::jsonb, 'Tranquil Japanese temple dry rock garden in Kyoto with raked white gravel circles, moss boulders, and falling red maple leaves in morning mist.', 'Peaceful Japanese dry rock Karesansui Zen garden in a 14th-century Kyoto temple at sunrise. Concentric ripples raked into pristine white gravel around moss-covered volcanic boulders, scarlet Japanese maple leaves resting gently on gravel, ethereal morning fog weaving through cedar temple veranda, Hasselblad X2D 100C, natural diffused light --ar 16:9 --style raw', 'people, tourists, plastic, bright modern objects, cartoon, low resolution', '{"aspectRatio":"16:9","recommendedModel":"Midjourney v6.1","guidanceScale":"Stylize 180","sampler":"Default"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb)
