VALUES (2001020, 1020, 'image', 'Nordic Glass Cantilever Cliff Villa in Fjord', 'nordic-glass-cliff-villa', 'Architecture & Spaces', 'architecture', 'premium', true, '16:9', 'Flux.1 Pro / Midjourney', '20 Oct 2026', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80', '["Architecture","Nordic","Luxury Villa","Fjord","Modernist"]'::jsonb, 'Ultra-modern glass and charred timber cantilever villa perched dramatically over a misty Norwegian fjord at twilight.', 'Architectural digest photography, a modern luxury glass and black charred Yakisugi cedar wood villa cantilevered over a dramatic sheer cliff above Geirangerfjord Norway. Huge floor-to-ceiling illuminated glass walls showing minimalist warm Scandinavian interior with fireplace, reflection on infinity pool, misty pine mountains in dusk background, architectural photography, shot on tilt-shift 24mm lens, golden warm interior against cool blue twilight exterior --ar 16:9 --style raw', 'distorted geometry, crooked lines, messy architecture, cartoon textures', '{"aspectRatio":"16:9","recommendedModel":"Flux.1 Pro / Midjourney v6.1","guidanceScale":"3.0","sampler":"DPM++ SDE"}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb)
